Also need start clamped? scrollTop could theoretically exceed content height but tests use maxScroll. Also ensure padBottom >= 0 via clamp of end <= total; also end >= start to keep rendered non-negative when scrollTop beyond bottom — clamp start too: start = min(start, total). Let me add that defensively: if scrollTop > total*rowHeight, floor gives start > total; then clamp start to total and end to max(start,...). Keep it simple:

